  "bio": {
    "eyebrow": "About Dr Yun",
    "heading_lead": "Meet",
    "heading_warm": "Dr Yun.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Dr Jenny Yun is an independent Consultant Specialist GP (ABN: 42 453 942 719) (MED0002217577) consulting at the Earlwood centre.",
      "Dr Jenny completed her Doctor of Medicine at the University of Melbourne. She began her medical career in Victoria, working at the Royal Melbourne Hospital and Peter MacCallum Cancer Centre before relocating to Sydney to undertake her General Practice training. She has also completed the Sydney Child Health Program.",
      "Dr Yun enjoys all aspects of general practice, with particular interests in dermatology and women’s health. She holds a Certificate of Dermoscopy from the Skin Cancer College Australasia and is trained in Implanon insertion and removal.",
      "Alongside her clinical work, Dr Yun is involved in academic medicine as a casual Associate Lecturer at the University of Sydney Medical School, where she contributes to teaching medical students and research. She has published eight articles in peer-reviewed journals.",
      "Dr Yun is fluent in both English and Korean."
    ]
  },
